    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53af48a2c0544cc5bfd68451",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质拥有坚定的忠实粉丝，\n也在“菊花赏”确实发挥出实力，\n现在的她一定能够挑战“有马纪念”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "312d409df0636a4faee6a7ced0e2b558184cc71f102de0eb39927afd9ade82a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060311.json",
