      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e727fb423703b5e49fcba59b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "竞赛结束后，从观众席传来的讨论声，\n证明优秀素质跑出了\n“属于自己的比赛”。而且──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5abd7f8d078c2fcffa5624fbe6d66b1352e824a7c257dfc9011311ed0317a8b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad0e30ea4ad3d134f70bd480",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅如此，“有马纪念”的参赛者\n都是今年倍受瞩目的各位赛马娘。\n跟她们一起比赛一定能带来更多成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d70429bf3e3f003b43a6ee3391b72a639686b9a192b3b3d72e610a9f65ab0571",
